VALUES ('b4c8a9a6-f12f-51c7-9cb4-32e61fcb4505', 'c730d58d-26e4-5c33-bef2-1cb399d6195c', 'gender', 'Gender', 'Gender classification where required by the business process. permitted business processes only. person attribute and not role. process-specific. optional. The gender of the person is female; set it when that is what the business means for this record. The gender of the person is male; set it when that is what the business means for this record. The gender of the person is non binary; set it when that is what the business means for this record. The gender of the person is other; set it when that is what the business means for this record. The gender of the person is unspecified; set it when that is what the business means for this record.', 1019, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 90, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
