VALUES ('8ee3797c-6a3f-581d-8c86-05b44884f89d', '0777a7de-46ff-5aa0-87bf-8a6341357c18', 'registration_number', 'Registration Number', 'Captures the business meaning of registration number for the Vehicle. It is interpreted together with the entity''s other attributes and relationships to support the processes that manage this record. Used when creating, reviewing, searching, validating, reporting on, or integrating Vehicle records, where applicable. Its meaning is specific to Vehicle; it must be interpreted with the entity''s relationships, lifecycle, and business rules rather than as an isolated technical value. Required because the business model cannot reliably interpret the record for its declared purpose without this value.', 10, 100, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 20, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
