VALUES ('412fb480-1554-55d5-aa36-5aed7061bb18', '0777a7de-46ff-5aa0-87bf-8a6341357c18', 'vehicle_type', 'Vehicle Type', 'Captures the business meaning of vehicle type for the Vehicle. It is interpreted together with the entity''s other attributes and relationships to support the processes that manage this record. Used when creating, reviewing, searching, validating, reporting on, or integrating Vehicle records, where applicable. Its meaning is specific to Vehicle; it must be interpreted with the entity''s relationships, lifecycle, and business rules rather than as an isolated technical value. Represents the truck state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Represents the tractor state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Represents the trailer state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Represents the forklift state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Represents the crane state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Represents the other state or classification in the context of Vehicle. Required because the business model cannot reliably interpret the record for its declared purpose without this value.', 1037, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 30, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
